    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "UNITED\nEffective October 28, 1984\nSan Francisco /\nOakland/ San Jose\nFIRST\nTO FLY\nALL 50\nSTATES\nThink of us First",
      "ONCE YOU'VE HAD A \"LACE EMBRACE\"\nYOU'LL TURN YOUR BACK ON ALL\nOTHERS!\nsensuous styling and an elegant lace back is what\n\"Lace Embrace\n•by Lily of France is all about\nThe beautiful underwire front hook bra and the\nbikini offer you the softest and smoothest shaping\npossible.\n#1550 Soft Cup Bra\n32-34-36 White, Beige, Pink, Peach Frost\nBlue Frost, $10.00\nWe\nrecommend\n#1551 Underwire Front Hook Bra\nWoolite\n34-36\nB 32-34-36 C $12.50\ncold water\nWhite, Beige, Pink, Peach Frost, Blue Frost\nwash\n#3550 Bikini S-M-L $6.50\nWhite, Beige, Pink, Peach Frost, Blue Frost\nrder Now! Dial toll-free\n24 hours a day: 800-MACYS-85.\nReturn this with your payment or mail your order\nseparately to: Macy's, P.O. Box 606, Sacramento,\nCA 95803.\nThe above styles are imported.\nstyle no.\nSIZe\ncolor\naty.\nprice\nTax\nDelivery charge\nTotal\nName\nAddress\nCity\n_ State\n. Zip\nDaytime Phone\n• Check/money order enclosed\nCharge to my account\nAccount Number.\nPlease add applicable tax for your area. In Macy's United Parcel de-\nadd 3.00 delivery charge. Outside Macy's U.P. zone, a\nare not necessarily shipped the same day. Macy's 170 'Farrell St.,\nS.F., CA 94102 D.642 5/85.\nC\nma cy s\nA\nN\n1\nA\n2001.136,073.002 b",
      "LACE EMBRACE.\n'LILY OF FRANCE*"
    ],
